{{Term/Store|Staminoka Bass|Staminoka Basses|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Creature]]s and [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Staminoka Bass}}
Staminoka Bass are [[Fish]] that can commonly be found in the waters of [[Hyrule]], or they can alternatively be purchased from the traveling merchant [[Bugut]]. Due to their naturally long lives, [[Meal]]s made by [[Cooking]] Staminoka Bass grant [[Stamina Restoration]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> Eating one raw restores one [[Heart]] to [[Link]]'s [[Life Gauge]]. They become [[Frozen Bass]] when exposed to [[Ice]] and [[Roasted Bass]] when burned by a [[Fire]].

